      <memberdef kind="function" id="aa_8h_1addc105e961590f011f3989170cd975c6" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="aa_8h_1a6ab1ca62f04bdb4c63d1cea9cb89b36f" kindref="member">aa_float</ref></type>
        <definition>aa_float aa_apply</definition>
        <argsstring>(aa_float *f, const aa_float *x, AaWork *a)</argsstring>
        <name>aa_apply</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="aa_8h_1a6ab1ca62f04bdb4c63d1cea9cb89b36f" kindref="member">aa_float</ref> *</type>
          <declname>f</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="aa_8h_1a6ab1ca62f04bdb4c63d1cea9cb89b36f" kindref="member">aa_float</ref> *</type>
          <declname>x</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="aa_8h_1abccab62fbdd940ce82c2e250335d8bcb" kindref="member">AaWork</ref> *</type>
          <declname>a</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Apply Anderson Acceleration. The usage pattern should be as follows:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>for i = 0 .. N:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>if (i &gt; 0): aa_apply(x, x_prev, a)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>x_prev = x.copy()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>x = F(x)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>aa_safeguard(x, x_prev, a) (optional but helps stability)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Here F is the map we are trying to find the fixed point for. We put the AA before the map so that any properties of the map are maintained at the end. Eg if the map contains a projection onto a set then the output is guaranteed to be in the set.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>f</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>output of map at current iteration, overwritten with AA output </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>x</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>input to map at current iteration </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>a</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>workspace from aa_init</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>(+ or -) norm of AA weights vector. If positive then update was accepted and f contains new point, if negative then update was rejected and f is unchanged </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
