<para>output of map after AA step </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>x_new</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>AA output that is input to the map </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
