<para>workspace from aa_init</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>0 if AA step is accepted otherwise -1, if AA step is rejected then this overwrites f_new and x_new with previous values </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
